  (text "U12: input OVLO/UVLO, soft-start, current limit and reverse blocking. ITIMER=NC: fastest response.\nU13: separate reverse blocking prevents actuator regeneration from reaching logic or USB. 2.02 A nominal branch limit.\nFaults hold MCU reset through 1k resistors. Source budgets and firmware state limits are separate from fault thresholds."
    (at 20 245 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "7dbb3a57-5ca0-5182-b1c3-39e1d10a5f3f"))
